---
import { conservation } from '@/data/guide';
---

<section id="conservation" class="bg-[#173227] py-24 text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-[#e2bd72]">SCIENCE &amp; RESPONSIBILITY</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">科普與訪客責任</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-white/65">
          奧爾森林學堂是一處城市中的生態教室。每一趟拜訪，都是與這片森林的溫柔約定——把觀察留下，把干擾帶走。
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {conservation.map((item) => (
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-white/8 p-5">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#e2bd72] text-sm font-semibold text-[#173227]" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <span class="leading-7 text-white/85">{item}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
